7] [17592186525059 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f0b7921b-6648-5449-80a2-dd554708f1c4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525059 #edb/ref 1074 "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic secant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arsech}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\operatorname{arsech}⁡({3}^{x})] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{3}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{({3}^{x})}^{2}}}\\cdot {({3}^{x})}^{′} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{3}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{9}^{x}}}\\cdot {3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3 \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\sqrt{1-{9}^{x}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186524933 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1069 "q-341460" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\nIf $y=-4\\,\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3-2x),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{|3-2x|}$\n{{field-1}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f7d0c5e9-6b20-5038-9084-51ca2beb31f0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186525063 #edb/ref 1074 "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\,[-4\\,\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3-2x)] \\\\  & =-4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\,[\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(3-2x)] \\\\  & =-4\\cdot [-\\frac{1}{|3-2x|\\sqrt{1+(3-2x)^{2}}}]\\cdot (3-2x)^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{|3-2x|\\sqrt{1+(9-12x+4{x}^{2})}}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{|3-2x|}\\,\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{10-12x+4{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 1759218